<!--
  Indirect AOI dependency fixture with NO explicit <Dependencies> blocks, and no Dependencies export
  option — what Logix Designer produces when exported through the GUI or an older SDK.

  The same ConsumerAOI -> BridgeUDT -> NestedAOI chain as sample_indirect_aoi_dependency.L5X, but the
  only evidence of it is the DataType attributes: ConsumerAOI has a Parameter of type BridgeUDT, and
  BridgeUDT has a Member of type NestedAOI. Nothing declares the relationship.

  The AOI order below is the "original" order and deliberately contradicts that dependency:
  ConsumerAOI is written before NestedAOI.
-->
